  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "The second thing adapters give us is, honestly, the bigger deal.",
      "start": 0.079,
      "end": 3.619
    },
    {
      "text": "Some qualities have no dataset to copy at all.",
      "start": 5.179,
      "end": 7.259
    },
    {
      "text": "Those Swiss apartments teach the model what a floor plan looks like they don't teach it what makes one good.",
      "start": 7.599,
      "end": 12.34
    },
    {
      "text": "There's no library of \"good\" lying around to copy.",
      "start": 12.679,
      "end": 14.96
    },
    {
      "text": "But here's the key insight: even when we can't show the model the right answer, we can SCORE the answer it gives us.",
      "start": 16.359,
      "end": 22.0
    },
    {
      "text": "So instead of \"copy this,\" the adapter learns from feedback here's the task, here's how you did, try again.",
      "start": 22.399,
      "end": 28.679
    },
    {
      "text": "And because it's an adapter, what it picks up that way combines with everything the imitation adapters already know.",
      "start": 29.099,
      "end": 34.419
    },
    {
      "text": "We score five things: does the room mix match the brief, do the rooms get daylight, is the circulation tight, does the furniture actually fit, and are the loads carried efficiently.",
      "start": 35.84,
      "end": 45.079
    },
    {
      "text": "One catch this loop runs millions of times, so every score has to come back in MILLISECONDS.",
      "start": 46.479,
      "end": 51.879
    },
    {
      "text": "If an evaluator's too slow, we make it fast.",
      "start": 51.939,
      "end": 54.519
    },
    {
      "text": "Which is exactly what we had to do for the structural check.",
      "start": 55.819,
      "end": 58.059
    }
  ]
}